<title>SINGAPORE: Hotel Royal proposes 2-for-3 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Hotel Royal proposes 2-for-3 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotel Royal Ltd said on Wednesday it was proposing a bonus issue on the basis of two new shares for every three shares held.</p>
<p>It said in a statement accompanying its 1996 results that it also planned to increase its authorised share capital to Singapore S$100 million from S$50 million. This would be done by creating 50 million shares of S$1.00 each, it said.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
